WEBVTT

00:11.630 --> 00:14.180
<b>[muffled, ethereal music plays softly]</b>

00:27.860 --> 00:29.860
<b>[ethereal music fades in]</b>

00:48.130 --> 00:49.920
<b>[sharp percussive beats play]</b>

00:51.130 --> 00:52.670
<b>[beats accelerate]</b>

00:52.760 --> 00:55.050
<b>[indistinct shouting]</b>

01:00.010 --> 01:01.600
<b>[grunting]</b>

01:05.350 --> 01:06.980
<b>[cries out]</b>

01:09.310 --> 01:11.570
<b>[complex jazzy music playing]</b>

01:25.000 --> 01:26.750
<b>[music softens]</b>

01:31.710 --> 01:33.170
<b>[shimmering sound]</b>

01:49.020 --> 01:49.900
<b>[men cry out]</b>

01:59.820 --> 02:00.990
<b>[grunting]</b>

02:07.370 --> 02:08.370
<b>[grunts]</b>

02:19.630 --> 02:22.140
<b>[men screaming]</b>

02:25.140 --> 02:27.140
<b>[triumphant laughter]</b>

02:28.140 --> 02:29.060
<b>[gasps]</b>

02:29.140 --> 02:30.690
<b>[ominous music plays]</b>

02:35.570 --> 02:38.070
<b>[shouting and grunting]</b>

02:38.150 --> 02:38.990
<b>[grunts]</b>

02:51.290 --> 02:53.880
<b>-[breathy, swirling sounds]
-[sinister rasping]</b>

03:03.090 --> 03:04.470
<b>[grunts softly]</b>

03:07.560 --> 03:08.560
<b>[grunts]</b>

03:19.320 --> 03:21.320
<b>[ominous music continues]</b>

03:26.450 --> 03:28.490
<b>-[grunts]
-[army roars]</b>

03:29.580 --> 03:31.000
<b>[yells]</b>

03:31.080 --> 03:33.710
<b>[raucous clamoring]</b>

03:34.420 --> 03:35.790
<b>-[swooshing]
-[splattering]</b>

03:37.710 --> 03:40.090
<b>-[ominous thud]
-[dark music plays]</b>

03:50.270 --> 03:51.680
<b>[loud bang]</b>

03:51.770 --> 03:53.770
<b>[raucous clamoring]</b>

03:56.770 --> 03:58.520
<b>[battle sounds fading]</b>

04:10.370 --> 04:14.790
<b>The Dark Army approaches, my lord.
But there is still time for us to escape.</b>

04:15.380 --> 04:17.090
<b>Why do you think he did it?</b>

04:17.590 --> 04:20.880
<b>I offered him land
to last his families a lifetime over.</b>

04:21.380 --> 04:23.800
<b>How could one be so stupid?</b>

04:24.510 --> 04:27.050
<b>Mitsuhide's prejudice grew beyond repair.</b>

04:27.550 --> 04:29.060
<b>Hojo Daimyo warped his mind</b>

04:29.140 --> 04:31.810
<b>and fed his anger
with power and corruption.</b>

04:32.310 --> 04:34.390
<b>[lord] I was referring to me.</b>

04:39.230 --> 04:41.990
<b>[grunts] And look at you, Yasuke.</b>

04:42.070 --> 04:44.530
<b>From servant to samurai.</b>

04:44.610 --> 04:46.820
<b>The only one who didn't betray me.</b>

04:46.910 --> 04:49.620
<b>-[metallic clink]
-We should drink to that.</b>

04:50.410 --> 04:52.160
<b>We do not have time for this.</b>

04:52.250 --> 04:54.710
<b>The Daimyo is going
to bring hell through those doors.</b>

04:54.790 --> 04:56.080
<b>Let them come.</b>

04:56.710 --> 04:59.710
<b>They are the guest of honor
to our little party.</b>

05:00.630 --> 05:01.460
<b>I--</b>

05:02.170 --> 05:04.090
<b>[Nobunaga] Yasuke, take it.</b>

05:04.170 --> 05:06.720
<b>Drink with me. Celebrate this moment.</b>

05:06.800 --> 05:09.390
<b>[raising voice]
What is there to celebrate, my lord?</b>

05:09.470 --> 05:13.220
<b>Your forces are scattered.
Your dream of a unified Japan is gone.</b>

05:13.310 --> 05:16.230
<b>-The temple walls burn as we speak--
-I am still your lord.</b>

05:24.690 --> 05:28.950
<b>If I die here,
perhaps Mitsuhide will let Ranmaru live.</b>

05:29.450 --> 05:31.700
<b>Are you sure he made it out in time?</b>

05:32.290 --> 05:35.500
<b>He was smuggled out
on the last ship, just as you requested.</b>

05:36.160 --> 05:38.830
<b>-Was he afraid?
-No, he was strong.</b>

05:39.330 --> 05:40.210
<b>Good.</b>

05:40.840 --> 05:44.920
<b>Now, all that is left for me
is an honorable death.</b>

05:45.010 --> 05:47.550
<b>My lord, if we barricade the side entrance</b>

05:47.630 --> 05:51.260
<b>and force them to enter through the halls,
we can bottleneck their forces</b>

05:51.350 --> 05:53.430
<b>and then cut them down in waves.</b>

05:53.510 --> 05:55.270
<b>-[grunts]
-[kettle clatters]</b>

05:55.350 --> 05:58.480
<b>I appoint you, Yasuke, as kaishakunin.</b>

05:59.150 --> 06:01.770
<b>This is my final command of you,
my friend.</b>

06:01.860 --> 06:05.070
<b>What? I don't understand.
We could still fight back.</b>

06:05.150 --> 06:07.820
<b>[lord] This is the only way
to save Ranmaru.</b>

06:07.900 --> 06:10.240
<b>No, there is no honor in this.</b>

06:10.320 --> 06:11.450
<b>-[wood cracks]
-[gasps]</b>

06:11.530 --> 06:13.200
<b>[flames crackling]</b>

06:15.290 --> 06:17.460
<b>[battle clamor outside]</b>

06:20.080 --> 06:22.130
<b>[Nobunaga] Thank you, Yasuke.</b>

06:22.210 --> 06:23.500
<b>[sword plunges]</b>

06:23.590 --> 06:26.010
<b>-[gasps]
-[grunting]</b>

06:29.180 --> 06:31.470
<b>[trembling breaths, grunting]</b>

06:37.810 --> 06:39.850
<b>[gasping] What are you waiting for?</b>

06:50.490 --> 06:52.370
<b>[groaning]</b>

06:55.660 --> 06:59.330
<b>[yells in Japanese] Do it! Do it!</b>

07:00.830 --> 07:02.380
<b>[yells]</b>

07:03.710 --> 07:05.210
<b>[gasps, panting]</b>

07:08.710 --> 07:10.720
<b>[birds chirping]</b>

07:16.220 --> 07:18.220
<b>[grunts, groans]</b>

07:25.820 --> 07:27.150
<b>[heaves]</b>

07:27.230 --> 07:29.900
<b>-[retching, coughing]
-[splashing]</b>

07:35.120 --> 07:36.410
<b>[clears throat]</b>

07:45.000 --> 07:47.300
<b>[gentle music plays]</b>

07:49.760 --> 07:50.670
<b>[grunts]</b>

08:03.190 --> 08:05.560
<b>[children laughing]</b>

08:05.650 --> 08:06.900
<b>Over here!</b>

08:06.980 --> 08:09.650
<b>Yassan! Over here!</b>

08:09.730 --> 08:11.190
<b>Whoa! [laughs]</b>

08:11.280 --> 08:12.610
<b>[all] Thanks!</b>

08:21.790 --> 08:23.210
<b>[no audible dialogue]</b>

08:46.690 --> 08:49.610
<b>-[birds chirping]
-[koto music playing]</b>

08:49.690 --> 08:51.530
<b>[footsteps approaching]</b>

08:58.200 --> 08:59.030
<b>[drink pours]</b>

08:59.120 --> 09:01.490
<b>[woman singing ethereal tune]</b>

09:18.890 --> 09:20.890
<b>-[shouts]
-[patrons gasp]</b>

09:20.970 --> 09:22.060
<b>Yassan!</b>

09:22.810 --> 09:24.640
<b>-[grunts]
-[patrons gasp]</b>

09:29.690 --> 09:31.940
<b>I almost landed my attack this time.</b>

09:32.020 --> 09:33.110
<b>[Yasuke groans]</b>

09:33.190 --> 09:34.990
<b>Stop bothering me.</b>

09:35.070 --> 09:36.110
<b>I don't care.</b>

09:36.200 --> 09:39.490
<b>Ichiro, I told you, no training in my bar.</b>

09:39.570 --> 09:41.450
<b>You're scaring away the customers.</b>

09:41.530 --> 09:42.950
<b>-[groaning]
-[glass shatters]</b>

09:49.210 --> 09:51.420
<b>[Ichiro] How do you
grow your hair like that?</b>

09:51.500 --> 09:53.710
<b>Where do you come from?
How did you get here?</b>

09:53.800 --> 09:56.510
<b>Who taught you how to fight?
Can they teach me?</b>

09:56.590 --> 09:57.590
<b>Can you teach me?</b>

09:57.680 --> 10:01.850
<b>I wanna fight in battles
like the great samurai warriors before me.</b>

10:01.930 --> 10:05.350
<b>I will succeed where they failed
and defeat the Daimyo.</b>

10:07.270 --> 10:08.100
<b>[Yasuke] Mm.</b>

10:08.190 --> 10:11.440
<b>A true warrior,
above all else, prays for peace.</b>

10:11.520 --> 10:12.610
<b>Not war.</b>

10:12.690 --> 10:14.980
<b>[Ichiro] War brings peace.</b>

10:15.070 --> 10:16.690
<b>Peace brings freedom.</b>

10:20.280 --> 10:22.780
<b>-[Yasuke steps onto boat]
-[gentle splashing]</b>

10:28.040 --> 10:30.120
<b>[bird screeches]</b>

10:30.210 --> 10:32.210
<b>[Ichiro] Hyah! Ha! Hah!</b>

10:32.290 --> 10:34.550
<b>I will save the land from the evil Daimyo.</b>

10:34.630 --> 10:35.630
<b>Who am I?</b>

10:35.710 --> 10:38.590
<b>I'm the greatest warrior in all the land.</b>

10:38.670 --> 10:40.800
<b>-Huah! [gasps]
-[man] Shut up. Stay right there!</b>

10:43.390 --> 10:44.310
<b>[grunts softly]</b>

10:45.430 --> 10:46.560
<b>[panting]</b>

10:46.640 --> 10:47.930
<b>[grunts, groans]</b>

10:49.890 --> 10:50.940
<b>[chuckles softly]</b>

10:51.020 --> 10:52.690
<b>[straining]</b>

10:52.770 --> 10:54.440
<b>[screaming]</b>

10:55.780 --> 10:56.940
<b>[assailant laughing]</b>

10:57.030 --> 10:58.490
<b>-[Ichiro] Ow!
-[thud]</b>

10:58.570 --> 10:59.570
<b>Who goes there?</b>

10:59.650 --> 11:02.070
<b>-[victim groaning]
-[Ichiro gasps]</b>

11:02.160 --> 11:04.160
<b>[panting]</b>

11:04.240 --> 11:05.080
<b>[grunts]</b>

11:06.660 --> 11:08.830
<b>[both laughing]</b>

11:10.410 --> 11:11.830
<b>-[sword plunges]
-[victim screams]</b>

11:11.920 --> 11:14.920
<b>-[overlapping chatter]
-[Ichiro panting]</b>

11:18.760 --> 11:20.800
<b>[woman] Practicing your swordplay again?</b>

11:20.880 --> 11:23.010
<b>[Ichiro] Practice? I'm a master.</b>

11:23.090 --> 11:24.970
<b>Master? Of what?</b>

11:25.050 --> 11:27.720
<b>Hey, Ichiro. Fight any bad guys today?</b>

11:27.810 --> 11:30.980
<b>Yep. Two soldiers outside the village.
Had them running scared.</b>

11:31.060 --> 11:34.060
<b>-[sighs] Those soldiers are dangerous.
-I'm dangerous too.</b>

11:34.150 --> 11:37.480
<b>-[chuckles] It's that samurai kid.
-I'm not a kid!</b>

11:37.570 --> 11:38.610
<b>Yes, you are!</b>

11:39.190 --> 11:41.610
<b>Can anyone help?</b>

11:42.240 --> 11:44.070
<b>Whatever you can spare.</b>

11:45.160 --> 11:45.990
<b>Mercy.</b>

11:48.370 --> 11:49.200
<b>[gasps]</b>

11:49.290 --> 11:50.120
<b>[chuckles]</b>

11:52.290 --> 11:53.370
<b>Thank you!</b>

11:54.460 --> 11:55.460
<b>[boy] Ichiro!</b>

11:57.750 --> 11:58.630
<b>Get him!</b>

11:59.300 --> 12:00.380
<b>[grunting]</b>

12:01.220 --> 12:02.380
<b>Ah! [groans]</b>

12:02.470 --> 12:05.140
<b>Hey! Come back here. Damn it!</b>

12:05.220 --> 12:06.850
<b>[Ichiro panting]</b>

12:10.180 --> 12:11.180
<b>[door opens]</b>

12:16.230 --> 12:17.400
<b>[sighs]</b>

12:17.480 --> 12:19.400
<b>Take off that silly mask.</b>

12:19.480 --> 12:21.820
<b>A samurai never shows his face.</b>

12:22.740 --> 12:25.910
<b>[girl] Ichiro,
I've already seen your face.</b>

12:30.700 --> 12:35.540
<b>So, Mr. Samurai,
did you finally land an attack on Yassan?</b>

12:35.620 --> 12:38.130
<b>No, but I came really close this time.</b>

12:38.210 --> 12:40.710
<b>I approached from his blind side,
but he felt me coming.</b>

12:40.800 --> 12:43.170
<b>I'll be better next time. [grunts]</b>

12:43.260 --> 12:44.680
<b>[chuckling] I know you will.</b>

12:45.340 --> 12:46.720
<b>Here, you try.</b>

12:47.510 --> 12:49.470
<b>[grunts softly] I don't know.</b>

12:52.480 --> 12:55.640
<b>It's okay.
You'll get your strength back soon enough.</b>

12:55.730 --> 12:57.560
<b>[shimmering sound]</b>

12:57.650 --> 12:59.400
<b>-[grunting]
-[shimmering]</b>

12:59.480 --> 13:00.320
<b>[girl shouts]</b>

13:05.820 --> 13:06.660
<b>Ah!</b>

13:07.160 --> 13:08.660
<b>[gasps] My bokken.</b>

13:09.410 --> 13:10.490
<b>[sighs]</b>

13:10.580 --> 13:12.370
<b>Yassan gave me this.</b>

13:12.450 --> 13:15.460
<b>I'm so sorry. I--
I don't know what happened.</b>

13:15.540 --> 13:18.210
<b>Saki, are you all right?</b>

13:19.290 --> 13:20.500
<b>I'm okay, Mother.</b>

13:22.550 --> 13:23.670
<b>You're on fire.</b>

13:23.760 --> 13:25.170
<b>Here, take this.</b>

13:30.260 --> 13:31.100
<b>[sighs]</b>

13:33.680 --> 13:34.930
<b>What happened?</b>

13:35.020 --> 13:37.650
<b>Saki was holding it,
and it just split in two.</b>

13:37.730 --> 13:39.100
<b>How will I train?</b>

13:42.940 --> 13:44.320
<b>[Saki] What's wrong, Mother?</b>

13:45.030 --> 13:47.240
<b>I think it's time
I take you to see the doctor.</b>

13:47.820 --> 13:51.200
<b>But you always said
the doctor was a great journey away.</b>

13:51.280 --> 13:53.620
<b>I like it here with my friends.</b>

13:53.700 --> 13:55.580
<b>There will be no discussion on this.</b>

13:57.000 --> 13:59.080
<b>-How long is the journey?
-[sighs]</b>

13:59.580 --> 14:00.920
<b>A week on foot.</b>

14:01.500 --> 14:03.800
<b>Yassan could get you there
in a day or two.</b>

14:03.880 --> 14:05.550
<b>The Black boatsman?</b>

14:05.630 --> 14:09.010
<b>Yes. He will be your guide,
and I will be your protection.</b>

14:09.090 --> 14:10.260
<b>[chuckles lightly]</b>

14:10.340 --> 14:12.260
<b>A child who thinks he's a samurai.</b>

14:13.600 --> 14:15.600
<b>I will be one, one day.</b>

14:18.230 --> 14:20.230
<b>[overlapping chatter, laughter]</b>

14:21.730 --> 14:23.230
<b>-[laughing]
-[door opens]</b>

14:23.320 --> 14:24.150
<b>Huh?</b>

14:28.860 --> 14:30.110
<b>-[grunts softly]
-[gasps]</b>

14:32.070 --> 14:33.160
<b>Vodka.</b>

14:33.240 --> 14:34.660
<b>Uh…</b>

14:36.910 --> 14:37.870
<b>What's that?</b>

14:37.960 --> 14:39.500
<b>I'm looking for someone.</b>

14:39.580 --> 14:40.960
<b>A woman with child.</b>

14:41.460 --> 14:42.380
<b>A little girl.</b>

14:42.460 --> 14:45.000
<b>Well, there's plenty
of women and children here.</b>

14:45.090 --> 14:45.920
<b>[sniffs]</b>

14:48.010 --> 14:49.930
<b>[singing indistinctly]</b>

14:50.010 --> 14:53.800
<b>Yeah, sometimes they piss themselves
whenever they get too drunk.</b>

14:55.060 --> 14:56.180
<b>Wait, no drink?</b>

14:59.770 --> 15:00.600
<b>Come with me.</b>

15:01.190 --> 15:02.400
<b>We have some fun.</b>

15:03.150 --> 15:04.820
<b>[muttering, chuckling]</b>

15:05.860 --> 15:06.690
<b>Me?</b>

15:07.530 --> 15:08.400
<b>Me?</b>

15:08.490 --> 15:10.200
<b>-Uh…
-Ah-- [grunts]</b>

15:14.030 --> 15:14.870
<b>Uh…</b>

15:15.530 --> 15:16.910
<b>I guess that's a vodka.</b>

15:19.370 --> 15:21.210
<b>[lord] What are you waiting for?</b>

15:21.290 --> 15:23.460
<b>[yells in Japanese] Do it!</b>

15:25.090 --> 15:25.960
<b>[sighs]</b>

15:27.800 --> 15:28.800
<b>[groans softly]</b>

15:30.470 --> 15:31.470
<b>Huh?</b>

15:32.340 --> 15:33.260
<b>[sighs]</b>

15:33.890 --> 15:36.970
<b>An empty bottle. I've failed you.</b>

15:37.060 --> 15:38.060
<b>[water flowing]</b>

15:38.720 --> 15:40.020
<b>[man] Black boatsman!</b>

15:42.560 --> 15:44.980
<b>What do you have for us today?</b>

15:45.060 --> 15:47.980
<b>-[man 2] Lunch.
-[man 1 chuckling] Oh…</b>

15:48.070 --> 15:49.230
<b>[man 1] Mm.</b>

15:49.320 --> 15:50.990
<b>Next time, Black boatsman.</b>

15:51.740 --> 15:52.700
<b>Next time.</b>

15:53.860 --> 15:56.370
<b>[slow, expectant music plays]</b>

15:59.790 --> 16:02.750
<b>[slow footsteps approach]</b>

16:03.960 --> 16:05.170
<b>[Ichiro shouts, grunts]</b>

16:05.250 --> 16:06.090
<b>[thud]</b>

16:07.750 --> 16:09.510
<b>How did I do, Yassan?</b>

16:09.590 --> 16:12.880
<b>Hmm. You would have
done better with your bokken.</b>

16:14.550 --> 16:16.390
<b>I'm sorry. It split in two.</b>

16:17.010 --> 16:21.060
<b>I made that myself. You're not
strong enough to split it in two.</b>

16:21.140 --> 16:23.890
<b>-I didn't break it!
-[Saki's mother] Black boatsman.</b>

16:25.190 --> 16:27.900
<b>This little one here
says you can help my daughter.</b>

16:27.980 --> 16:29.980
<b>My name is Ichika.</b>

16:30.070 --> 16:31.650
<b>I sing here sometimes.</b>

16:32.240 --> 16:34.150
<b>Yes, I know who you are.</b>

16:34.740 --> 16:36.200
<b>You have a… [hesitates]</b>

16:36.280 --> 16:37.160
<b>…lovely voice.</b>

16:37.240 --> 16:38.580
<b>Thank you.</b>

16:38.660 --> 16:40.830
<b>-[Yasuke] You have a daughter?
-Yes.</b>

16:40.910 --> 16:42.330
<b>That's who broke my bokken.</b>

16:44.670 --> 16:46.880
<b>My daughter has grown very ill.</b>

16:46.960 --> 16:49.170
<b>We must travel upstream
a few days' journey</b>

16:49.250 --> 16:50.460
<b>for her to be cared for.</b>

16:50.550 --> 16:53.050
<b>The village here
has a doctor who can provide care.</b>

16:53.130 --> 16:56.590
<b>-There's no need to travel upstream.
-This is a special doctor.</b>

16:56.680 --> 16:58.850
<b>If we don't go, she will die.</b>

17:00.180 --> 17:01.810
<b>[Yasuke] She will die if we go.</b>

17:01.890 --> 17:05.140
<b>No one returns from the north.
The journey would be suicide.</b>

17:05.230 --> 17:07.190
<b>The warring territory is too dangerous.</b>

17:07.270 --> 17:10.150
<b>The risk of the journey
is worth saving her life.</b>

17:10.690 --> 17:12.900
<b>Just take her to the village doctor.</b>

17:19.410 --> 17:21.330
<b>[Ichiro grunting]</b>

17:28.710 --> 17:30.210
<b>You have no honor!</b>

17:30.290 --> 17:32.960
<b>You have no idea what honor is, boy.</b>

17:33.050 --> 17:35.340
<b>Honor is not willingly
giving up your life.</b>

17:37.340 --> 17:39.600
<b>Please, Yassan, save her.</b>

17:44.020 --> 17:45.850
<b>I said it's too dangerous.</b>

17:55.190 --> 17:57.700
<b>-[seabirds calling]
-[mellow music playing]</b>

18:11.340 --> 18:13.130
<b>[man] You will love what we brought.</b>

18:13.210 --> 18:15.760
<b>These items come from far and wide.</b>

18:15.840 --> 18:19.640
<b>You will be the only man on this side
of the world to claim such treasures.</b>

18:20.300 --> 18:21.640
<b>[Nobunaga] Ranmaru.</b>

18:21.720 --> 18:23.140
<b>What do you think?</b>

18:24.600 --> 18:26.520
<b>I think it is beautiful, my lord.</b>

18:27.560 --> 18:29.520
<b>I'll take it. Show me more.</b>

18:30.310 --> 18:33.900
<b>What did you say, boy?
You tell me I have no honor?</b>

18:35.730 --> 18:38.150
<b>You will pay for your insolence.</b>

18:38.650 --> 18:40.030
<b>[Yasuke, in Japanese] Wait!</b>

18:40.610 --> 18:43.030
<b>[in English] What honor is there
in striking down a child?</b>

18:43.120 --> 18:44.910
<b>What's going on here?</b>

18:44.990 --> 18:46.620
<b>I shall stop this at once.</b>

18:46.700 --> 18:49.080
<b>Wait. This could be interesting.</b>

18:49.160 --> 18:50.040
<b>Of course.</b>

18:50.120 --> 18:53.790
<b>You dare speak to me?
You allow your servant to speak?</b>

18:53.880 --> 18:56.550
<b>I apologize for his slippery tongue.</b>

18:56.630 --> 18:59.550
<b>He should know his place, shut his mouth.</b>

19:02.340 --> 19:04.560
<b>-[people gasp]
-[Yasuke] Leave the boy alone.</b>

19:04.640 --> 19:06.310
<b>[merchant mutters nervously]</b>

19:06.970 --> 19:07.810
<b>[chuckles]</b>

19:09.390 --> 19:11.810
<b>Guess I'll have
to shut your mouth for you.</b>

19:11.900 --> 19:14.310
<b>-[bystander] Get back, get back!
-[crowd murmurs]</b>

19:15.110 --> 19:16.980
<b>[mellow electronic music playing]</b>

19:23.160 --> 19:24.580
<b>[swordsman grunting]</b>

19:24.660 --> 19:26.080
<b>[both grunting]</b>

19:27.490 --> 19:29.080
<b>[gasps, groans]</b>

19:32.170 --> 19:34.000
<b>-[both grunting]
-[onlookers clamor]</b>

19:36.500 --> 19:37.340
<b>[gasps]</b>

19:38.920 --> 19:40.050
<b>[grunts]</b>

19:42.590 --> 19:43.840
<b>[light applause]</b>

19:48.770 --> 19:51.230
<b>[merchant, nervously]
I am so sorry, Lord Nobunaga.</b>

19:51.310 --> 19:53.350
<b>He will not go unpunished.</b>

19:53.440 --> 19:55.480
<b>No need. He fought well.</b>

19:55.980 --> 19:58.820
<b>A man deserves to be clean. Wash him.</b>

20:09.160 --> 20:10.950
<b>Why is he not clean?</b>

20:11.040 --> 20:14.710
<b>It is not dirt.
It is the color of his skin, my lord.</b>

20:15.540 --> 20:17.500
<b>Did you ink your skin black?</b>

20:18.670 --> 20:20.710
<b>No, I was born with black skin.</b>

20:20.800 --> 20:23.340
<b>You were born with black skin?</b>

20:23.930 --> 20:24.760
<b>[Yasuke] Yes.</b>

20:25.720 --> 20:28.350
<b>Interesting. What is your name?</b>

20:28.430 --> 20:30.350
<b>Eusebio Ibrahimo Baloi.</b>

20:31.060 --> 20:32.520
<b>[people gasp in confusion]</b>

20:32.600 --> 20:33.850
<b>Eu-- I--</b>

20:33.940 --> 20:36.480
<b>Eusebio Ibrahimo Baloi.</b>

20:37.270 --> 20:40.570
<b>[chuckling nervously] I--
I apologize for his rudeness.</b>

20:40.650 --> 20:42.400
<b>The Yao people have a… [hesitates]</b>

20:42.490 --> 20:44.780
<b>…strong cultural identity.</b>

20:44.860 --> 20:46.820
<b>Hmm. Yao.</b>

20:46.910 --> 20:49.120
<b>How about Yasuke?</b>

20:51.450 --> 20:52.500
<b>I like him.</b>

20:53.830 --> 20:55.040
<b>I'll take him too.</b>

21:06.300 --> 21:10.560
<b>[Ichika] Make sure you have everything.
If we leave now, we can avoid the patrols.</b>

21:11.220 --> 21:13.020
<b>[hushed] Mother. Someone is here.</b>

21:18.900 --> 21:20.440
<b>You're right to leave now.</b>

21:20.520 --> 21:24.780
<b>Patrols are light at this time.
It's wise to gain ground before dawn.</b>

21:25.570 --> 21:27.780
<b>Is Yassan taking us, Mother?</b>

21:35.410 --> 21:36.330
<b>Yes.</b>

21:37.120 --> 21:38.290
<b>He is.</b>

21:52.350 --> 21:54.430
<b>[overlapping murmurs]</b>

21:59.100 --> 22:00.900
<b>[grunting lightly]</b>

22:00.980 --> 22:06.490
<b>Beautiful land and home.
Lord Nobunaga shows favor.</b>

22:07.110 --> 22:11.030
<b>Impressive, especially
for an outsider such as yourself.</b>

22:12.120 --> 22:16.200
<b>-You were there that day.
-Indeed. You saved my little brother here.</b>

22:16.790 --> 22:18.870
<b>For that, you have my gratitude.</b>

22:19.790 --> 22:23.420
<b>Where I'm from, it's everyone's
duty to protect the children of the land.</b>

22:23.500 --> 22:26.170
<b>-You're a samurai, yes?
-Onna Bugeisha.</b>

22:26.260 --> 22:30.550
<b>[Yasuke] Is it common in this country for
a woman to gain such a high military rank?</b>

22:30.640 --> 22:32.640
<b>[woman] No. No, it is not.</b>

22:33.350 --> 22:34.470
<b>[Yasuke] Impressive.</b>

22:34.560 --> 22:37.560
<b>[woman] Nobunaga awards
those who have proven themselves.</b>

22:37.640 --> 22:39.140
<b>As you can attest.</b>

22:39.640 --> 22:42.810
<b>You could have defended
your brother yourself. Why didn't you?</b>

22:43.900 --> 22:48.950
<b>The code of the samurai forbids me
to interfere when honor is challenged.</b>

22:49.450 --> 22:51.740
<b>My brother made a grave mistake.</b>

22:51.820 --> 22:54.370
<b>What you did
was honorable in its own right.</b>

22:54.450 --> 22:55.790
<b>You have my respect.</b>

22:56.620 --> 22:58.750
<b>And whose respect do I have?</b>

22:58.830 --> 23:00.330
<b>I am Natsumaru.</b>

23:00.420 --> 23:05.000
<b>And what do they call you,
the samurai that was once a servant?</b>

23:05.670 --> 23:06.510
<b>Yasuke.</b>

23:12.340 --> 23:14.050
<b>[gasps, sighs]</b>

23:14.140 --> 23:15.260
<b>[lapping water]</b>

23:16.850 --> 23:18.140
<b>[Ichika] You snore.</b>

23:18.810 --> 23:20.190
<b>Hm-- What's her name?</b>

23:20.770 --> 23:23.520
<b>Saki. She's gotten worse
in the past few weeks.</b>

23:23.610 --> 23:25.150
<b>Does she always sweat like this?</b>

23:26.530 --> 23:27.730
<b>The sweating is new.</b>

23:28.820 --> 23:30.320
<b>You should get more rest.</b>

23:32.860 --> 23:36.910
<b>The boy wants to be a great warrior.
He looks up to you.</b>

23:37.490 --> 23:39.450
<b>Why? Who are you?</b>

23:40.120 --> 23:42.040
<b>I'm just a boatsman.</b>

23:42.120 --> 23:46.420
<b>Nothing special about me.
He's just impatient to become a man.</b>

23:46.500 --> 23:49.760
<b>Well, I've seen the way
you move to avoid his attacks.</b>

23:49.840 --> 23:51.510
<b>I hear the things you say,</b>

23:51.590 --> 23:56.100
<b>the way you yell out in your sleep,
like a man haunted by his past.</b>

23:57.720 --> 23:58.930
<b>The necklace you wear.</b>

24:00.020 --> 24:03.190
<b>That symbol is familiar.
I-I've seen it before.</b>

24:04.770 --> 24:07.320
<b>-[Ichika] Why are you doing this?
-Doing what?</b>

24:07.400 --> 24:10.320
<b>Helping us. Why did you change your mind?</b>

24:12.820 --> 24:13.910
<b>[Yasuke] One village.</b>

24:14.490 --> 24:16.240
<b>[Ichika] And what does that mean?</b>

24:16.320 --> 24:19.790
<b>[Yasuke] Where I'm from, every man
and woman cares for every child.</b>

24:20.370 --> 24:23.040
<b>It is our duty
to make sure every child is safe.</b>

24:23.540 --> 24:25.830
<b>-[Saki coughing]
-[Ichika] It's okay.</b>

24:25.920 --> 24:30.090
<b>[Yasuke] I've seen many illnesses
but nothing like this.</b>

24:30.760 --> 24:32.720
<b>She's a special child.</b>

24:32.800 --> 24:35.590
<b>She requires special care.
That is all you need to know.</b>

24:36.550 --> 24:38.100
<b>-[tinkling sound]
-Huh?</b>

24:41.180 --> 24:42.230
<b>Why are you stopping?</b>

24:42.310 --> 24:44.310
<b>I am not stopping.</b>

24:49.400 --> 24:51.440
<b>[mellow music playing]</b>

24:59.370 --> 25:01.620
<b>[whooshing]</b>

25:09.670 --> 25:10.710
<b>[robot] He's Black.</b>

25:10.800 --> 25:12.420
<b>We can see that.</b>

25:12.510 --> 25:15.180
<b>[robot] I thought you were
the only Black man in Japan.</b>

25:15.260 --> 25:16.840
<b>[chuckles] Apparently not.</b>

25:16.930 --> 25:18.550
<b>[robot] Are you two related?</b>

25:18.640 --> 25:20.100
<b>[man] Shut up, scrap metal.</b>

25:20.180 --> 25:22.180
<b>[woman] He's kinda cute for an old man.</b>

25:22.270 --> 25:24.730
<b>[robot] Your attraction
to him is illogical.</b>

25:24.810 --> 25:25.730
<b>[snaps]</b>

25:30.690 --> 25:32.480
<b>The child, Chernyy.</b>

25:36.570 --> 25:38.240
<b>Why are you here for this child?</b>

25:38.820 --> 25:40.870
<b>So be it, Chernyy.</b>

25:41.450 --> 25:42.790
<b>[sighs deeply]</b>

25:43.450 --> 25:44.620
<b>So be it,</b>

25:45.460 --> 25:46.370
<b>indeed.</b>

25:47.330 --> 25:51.000
<b>[in Japanese] No honor to be had here.
Only pain and blood.</b>

25:51.670 --> 25:55.010
<b>-[in English] What was that?
-He just spoke Japanese.</b>

25:55.090 --> 25:57.010
<b>The Black man spoke Japanese?</b>

25:57.090 --> 25:59.010
<b>Yes. I spoke Japanese.</b>

25:59.090 --> 26:02.350
<b>You speak Japanese
and recite ancient proverbs.</b>

26:02.850 --> 26:04.930
<b>You must have lived a good life.</b>

26:05.020 --> 26:05.850
<b>[grunts]</b>

26:07.690 --> 26:09.100
<b>[Yasuke grunts]</b>

26:13.400 --> 26:14.610
<b>[Yasuke panting]</b>

26:23.240 --> 26:25.080
<b>[both grunting]</b>

26:27.120 --> 26:28.540
<b>[rhythmic music playing]</b>

26:30.960 --> 26:32.040
<b>[exclaims]</b>

26:41.760 --> 26:42.850
<b>[grunts]</b>

26:48.850 --> 26:50.850
<b>[growling]</b>

26:53.020 --> 26:54.610
<b>[low roar]</b>

26:56.030 --> 26:56.860
<b>[snarls]</b>

27:01.110 --> 27:02.280
<b>[Ichika grunts]</b>

27:08.290 --> 27:09.370
<b>[snarls]</b>

27:13.130 --> 27:14.130
<b>[Ichika shouts]</b>

27:19.050 --> 27:20.050
<b>[Saki gasps]</b>

27:23.140 --> 27:25.220
<b>-Mother!
-[groaning]</b>

27:25.310 --> 27:27.310
<b>[growls, snarling]</b>

27:28.810 --> 27:30.230
<b>[yells] Leave us alone!</b>

27:36.150 --> 27:38.150
<b>[Yasuke straining]</b>

27:43.620 --> 27:44.950
<b>[energy blasting]</b>

27:45.910 --> 27:47.200
<b>[splashing]</b>

27:58.210 --> 28:00.720
<b>["Between Memories"
by Flying Lotus playing]</b>

28:18.860 --> 28:20.190
<b>[girl laughing]</b>

28:20.280 --> 28:23.570
<b>♪ I want in, not waiting ♪</b>

28:24.070 --> 28:26.200
<b>♪ We're out to leave now ♪</b>

28:26.280 --> 28:30.450
<b>♪ Don't worry 'bout the weather
We're setting out together ♪</b>

28:31.080 --> 28:34.330
<b>♪ I want in, not waiting ♪</b>

28:34.830 --> 28:36.960
<b>♪ We're out to leave now ♪</b>

28:37.040 --> 28:41.340
<b>♪ Don't worry 'bout the weather
We're setting out together ♪</b>

28:41.840 --> 28:43.840
<b>[female vocalizing]</b>

28:46.890 --> 28:48.430
<b>[indistinct chatter]</b>

28:50.010 --> 28:52.520
<b>-[female vocalizing]
-♪ Come on ♪</b>

29:00.280 --> 29:02.240
<b>[girl laughing]</b>

29:02.320 --> 29:03.450
<b>♪ Come on ♪</b>

29:06.950 --> 29:08.950
<b>[girl laughing]</b>
